"text": "paseo.", "type": "word", "start": 22.56, "end": 23.28}, {"text": "Eso", "type": "word", "start": 23.36, "end": 23.6}, {"text": "genera", "type": "word", "start": 23.68, "end": 24}, {"text": "confianza.", "type": "word", "start": 24.16, "end": 24.92}, {"text": "[serious]", "type": "word", "start": 25.12, "end": 25.168}, {"text": "Eso", "type": "word", "start": 25.184, "end": 25.36}, {"text": "sí:", "type": "word", "start": 25.44, "end": 26.08}, {"text": "acepta", "type": "word", "start": 26.2, "end": 26.64}, {"text": "solo", "type": "word", "start": 26.72, "end": 26.96}, {"text": "animales", "type": "word", "start": 27.12, "end": 27.44}, {"text": "que", "type": "word", "start": 27.52, "end": 27.68}, {"text": "puedas", "type": "word", "start": 27.72, "end": 28.08}, {"text": "controlar,", "type": "word", "start": 28.28, "end": 28.96}, {"text": "y", "type": "word", "start": 29.04, "end": 29.2}, {"text": "nunca", "type": "word", "start": 29.28, "end": 29.68}, {"text": "vayas", "type": "word", "start": 29.76, "end": 30.08}, {"text": "solo", "type": "word", "start": 30.12, "end": 30.32}, {"text": "a", "type": "word", "start": 30.36, "end": 30.4}, {"text": "la", "type": "word", "start": 30.48, "end": 30.56}, {"text": "casa", "type": "word", "start": 30.64, "end": 30.8}, {"text": "de", "type": "word", "start": 30.84, "end": 30.88}, {"text": "un", "type": "word", "start": 30.96, "end": 31}, {"text": "desconocido.", "type": "word", "start": 31.04, "end": 31.92}], "text": "[energetic] Número nueve: pasear y cuidar mascotas.\n\nHay dueños que trabajan todo el día, y sus perros necesitan salir. Otros se van de viaje y no tienen con quién dejar a su gato. Si amas los animales, este trabajo casi no se siente como trabajo.\n\nEmpieza con las mascotas de familiares y vecinos, sé puntual, y mándales fotos a los dueños durante el paseo. Eso genera confianza.\n\n[serious] Eso sí: acepta solo animales que puedas controlar, y nunca vayas solo a la casa de un desconocido."}